 r←Test_SelectionTool_017(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;v;data;⎕TRAP
⍝ Preselect some item with checkboxes and then performs several sorts by column. Is result still usable?
⍝ "style" defaults to "single" but is ignored when "checkboxes"=1.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.addToCaption←'Multiple columns'
 parms.minSize←⍬ 700
 parms.posn←60 70
 parms.size←⍬ 720
 parms.checkboxes←1
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 (data parms.colTitles)←∆BuildMatrixForListView
 data←60↑data
 parms.default←10 11 40 50{⍵∊⍺}⍳0⊃⍴data
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.Create data
 1 ⎕NQ n.List'ColumnClick' 4 1 0
 1 ⎕NQ n.List'ColumnClick' 1 1 0
 1 ⎕NQ n.List'ColumnClick' 3 1 0
 ⎕DQ'.'
 →PassesIf(parms.default⌿data[;0])≡n.∆result⌿data[;0]

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
